OL,3,GNEWSANo further action after town
OL,4,Acentre murder arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo further action will be taken against
OL,7,Ftwo people who were arrested as part of
OL,8,Fan investigation into the death of a
OL,9,Fman.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called after
OL,12,Fthe man, in his 40s, was found
OL,13,Funresponsive on Astley Gate in
OL,14,FBlackburn town centre in the early
OL,15,Fhours of Monday.
OL,17,FLancashire Police said following a
OL,18,Fpost-mortem examination, it had been
OL,19,Festablished there was no third party
OL,20,Finvolvement in the man's death.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
