OL,3,GNEWSANo further action after town
OL,4,Acentre murder arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s and a woman in her 30s
OL,7,Fwho were both arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fmurder have now been released with no
OL,9,Ffurther action, the force said.
